you would manage to get is Texas, which I mean,&nbsp;
you know, just look at the data. Texas is no, it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:42.360
no beauty when it comes to access to health care,&nbsp;
education, quality, all these different things.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:49.860
You get yourself to taxes will get you to a&nbsp;
much better state by most metrics. By pulling&nbsp;&nbsp;

