00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:09.540
care, better infrastructure and better education.&nbsp;
They claim to want to disincentivize that very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:15.000
undocumented immigration. It's a pathetic stunt.&nbsp;
I don't know what this does to public opinion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

